WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.738 --> 00:00:04.507
RETALIATION, THERE HAS BEEN NO

00:00:04.508 --> 00:00:05.541
INDEPENDENT COOPERATION OF THAT

00:00:05.542 --> 00:00:05.875
REPORT.

00:00:05.876 --> 00:00:07.977
AT LEAST TWO PEOPLE ARE DEAD AS

00:00:07.978 --> 00:00:10.679
WILDFIRES IN THE U.S. RAGE IN

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:11.080
CALIFORNIA.

00:00:11.081 --> 00:00:13.182
THE OUTBREAK COMES DESPITE

00:00:13.183 --> 00:00:13.916
EXTRAORDINARY MEASURES BY POWER

00:00:13.917 --> 00:00:16.152
COMPANIES TO MINIMIZE THE RISK

00:00:16.153 --> 00:00:16.952
THERE.

00:00:16.953 --> 00:00:17.653
NATIONAL CORRESPONDENT WILLIAM

00:00:17.654 --> 00:00:21.357
LA JEUNESSE IS LIVE TONIGHT IN

00:00:21.358 --> 00:00:22.024
PORTER RANCH NEIGHBORHOOD OF

00:00:22.025 --> 00:00:22.424
LOS ANGELES.

00:00:22.425 --> 00:00:25.127
GOOD EVENING, WILLIAM.

00:00:25.128 --> 00:00:27.263
&gt;&gt; THE FIRE BEGAN 9:00 LAST

00:00:27.264 --> 00:00:29.365
NIGHT WHEN THE SANTA ANA WINDS

00:00:29.366 --> 00:00:30.699
JUMP OVER THE RIDGE, RACED INTO

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:32.067
THE L.A. BASIN, DEVASTATED THIS

00:00:32.068 --> 00:00:34.970
COMMUNITY WHILE MANY SLEPT.

00:00:34.971 --> 00:00:37.473
&gt;&gt; I COULD SEE THE FLAMES COMING

00:00:37.474 --> 00:00:37.973
OVER THAT RIDGE.

00:00:37.974 --> 00:00:40.109
I SAY, WE GOT TO GO.

00:00:40.110 --> 00:00:42.311
&gt;&gt; EVERYTHING IS FIRE UP THERE.

00:00:42.312 --> 00:00:44.280
THE HOUSE IS, EVERYTHING IS ON

00:00:44.281 --> 00:00:44.580
FIRE.

00:00:44.581 --> 00:00:44.947
IT'S BAD.

00:00:44.948 --> 00:00:51.453
&gt;&gt; THE FIRE EXPLODING AS WINDS

00:00:51.454 --> 00:00:53.422
SWEEP THROUGH THE SAN FERNANDO

00:00:53.423 --> 00:00:53.756
VALLEY.

00:00:53.757 --> 00:00:55.224
&gt;&gt; SHORTLY BEFORE SUNRISE AT

00:00:55.225 --> 00:00:55.658
PORTER RANCH.

00:00:55.659 --> 00:01:00.262
THIS FIRE IS 0% CONTAINED.

00:01:00.263 --> 00:01:01.564
&gt;&gt; NOBODY KNOWS WHAT THESE WINS.

00:01:01.565 --> 00:01:03.299
WE ARE HOPING FOR THE BEST.

00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:07.069
&gt;&gt; 100,000 EVACUATED HERE AND

00:01:07.070 --> 00:01:09.004
TWO FATALITIES, A MAN IN HIS

00:01:09.005 --> 00:01:09.872
50s SUFFERED A HEART ATTACK

00:01:09.873 --> 00:01:11.707
TRYING TO PROTECT HIS HOME.

00:01:11.708 --> 00:01:13.876
ANOTHER DIED OF THIS FIRE, EAST

00:01:13.877 --> 00:01:14.610
OF LOS ANGELES, THAT DESTROYED A

00:01:14.611 --> 00:01:16.078
MOBILE HOME PARK.

00:01:16.079 --> 00:01:18.714
&gt;&gt; THIS IS GOING TO TAKE A FEW

00:01:18.715 --> 00:01:19.014
DAYS.

00:01:19.015 --> 00:01:20.816
&gt;&gt; WITH STRONG SUSTAINED WINDS

00:01:20.817 --> 00:01:22.818
AND HUMIDITY UNDER 10% FROM THE

00:01:22.819 --> 00:01:24.486
FIREFIGHTERS ARE ON DEFENSE

00:01:24.487 --> 00:01:26.288
PROTECTING HOMES AND DROPPING

00:01:26.289 --> 00:01:27.122
RETARDANT, HOPING TO SLOW THE

00:01:27.123 --> 00:01:30.092
FIRE TO SOME 800 ACRES AN HOUR.

00:01:30.093 --> 00:01:31.694
&gt;&gt; IT'S A ROUGH ESTIMATE RIGHT

00:01:31.695 --> 00:01:32.962
NOW, BUT WE ARE LOOKING AT A

00:01:32.963 --> 00:01:35.698
NUMBER OF AT LEAST 25 HOMES HAVE

00:01:35.699 --> 00:01:37.099
BEEN DAMAGED.

00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:38.534
&gt;&gt; SEVERAL HUNDRED THOUSAND

00:01:38.535 --> 00:01:39.301
CALIFORNIANS MOSTLY IN THE

00:01:39.302 --> 00:01:41.170
NORTHERN PART OF THE STATE

00:01:41.171 --> 00:01:42.938
REMAINED WITHOUT ELECTRICITY AS

00:01:42.939 --> 00:01:44.974
POWER COMPANIES HAVE VOLUNTARILY

00:01:44.975 --> 00:01:45.975
PULLED THE PLUG FEARING

00:01:45.976 --> 00:01:48.277
LIABILITY WITH DOWNED POWER

00:01:48.278 --> 00:01:48.677
LINES.

00:01:48.678 --> 00:01:50.179
&gt;&gt; WE ARE SEEING THE SCALE AND

00:01:50.180 --> 00:01:52.615
SCOPE OF SOMETHING THAT NO STATE

00:01:52.616 --> 00:01:54.717
IN THE 21ST CENTURY SHOULD

00:01:54.718 --> 00:01:55.884
EXPERIENCE.

00:01:55.885 --> 00:01:59.955
WHAT'S HAPPENED IS UNACCEPTABLE.

00:01:59.956 --> 00:02:02.591
&gt;&gt; IN ADDITION TO CRITICISM FROM

00:02:02.592 --> 00:02:04.526
GOVERNOR NEWSOM, A FAMILY OF A

00:02:04.527 --> 00:02:05.194
67-YEAR-OLD MAN IN NORTHERN

00:02:05.195 --> 00:02:08.397
CALIFORNIA IS BLAMING THE

00:02:08.398 --> 00:02:09.665
UTILITY WHEN HIS OXYGEN MACHINE

00:02:09.666 --> 00:02:11.067
STOPS 12 MINUTES AFTER THE

